<title>HONG KONG: Soc Generale sets warrants on Swire Pac.</title>
<headline>Soc Generale sets warrants on Swire Pac.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGA, Societe Generale Acceptance NV said it issued 51 million American-style call warrants on A shares of Swire Pacific Ltd on Monday.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p>    STRIKE PRICE    HK$70.75	PREMIUM	  14 PCT</p>
<p>    ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.99	 GEARING	  7.14X</p>
<p>    EXPIRATION	14.OCT.97     PAYDATE	  14.NOV.96</p>
<p>    LISTING	   HONG KONG     LISTING DATE   18.NOV.96</p>
<p>    MIN EXER LOT    5,000	   SPOT REFERENCE HK$70.75</p>
<p>    NOTES	STOCK DELIVERY OR CASH SETTLEMENT AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>CHOICE</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
